cription published on the web, read live or from a web-archive capture of the page, NOT the signed or officially printed original; a lead to the original and to the text, never the original by itself"}],"savings_leads":[],"whole_order_end":[],"whole_order_end_total":0},"provisional_status":"yes","readiness":{"by_step":{"clause_inventory":"research","counterevidence":"confirm","ending_or_current_basis":"research","opus_media":"research","original_text":"confirm","savings_residuals":"agent_judgment","shared_sources":"n/a"},"needs_research":["clause_inventory","ending_or_current_basis","opus_media"],"would_satisfy_once_confirmed":["original_text","counterevidence"]},"shared_sources":[],"signing_dates_seen":{"fr-originals@jobs/fr-originals/output":"1969-11-13","later-events_catalog":"1969-11-13","stage19_causal_queue":"1969-11-13"},"source_ladder_exhausted_proposed":[],"status":"MACHINE DRAFT - UNVERIFIED; not a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:11494","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ection  1. Medal established. The Presidential Citizens Medal (here­\ninafter referred to as the Medal), together with accompanying ribbons  \nand appurtenances, is hereby established for the purpose of recog­\nnizing citizens of the United States of America who have performed  \nexemplary deeds of service for their country or their fellow citizens.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"34 FR 18291, PDF pages 7-7; Sec. 1","sha256":"f522d7ceb7cb8dd8a14d4ceaad5eecedb213f066d2dd6b9e5fc36c9b76b4d445","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1969-11-15/pdf/FR-1969-11-15.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11494#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The Medal may be bestowed by  \nthe President upon any citizen of the United States at the sole discre­\ntion of the President.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"34 FR 18291, PDF pages 7-7; Sec. 2(a)","sha256":"f522d7ceb7cb8dd8a14d4ceaad5eecedb213f066d2dd6b9e5fc36c9b76b4d445","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1969-11-15/pdf/FR-1969-11-15.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11494#sec2(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The announcement of the granting of the Medal and the pres­\nentation ceremonies may take place at any time during the year.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"34 FR 18291, PDF pages 7-7; Sec. 2(b)","sha256":"f522d7ceb7cb8dd8a14d4ceaad5eecedb213f066d2dd6b9e5fc36c9b76b4d445","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1969-11-15/pdf/FR-1969-11-15.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11494#sec2(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) Subject to the provisions of this order, the Medal may be con­\nferred posthumously.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"34 FR 18291, PDF pages 7-7; Sec. 2(c)","sha256":"f522d7ceb7cb8dd8a14d4ceaad5eecedb213f066d2dd6b9e5fc36c9b76b4d445","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1969-11-15/pdf/FR-1969-11-15.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11494#sec2(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec. 3. Design of the Medal.  The Army Institute of Heraldry shall  \nprepare for the approval of the President a design of the Medal,  \ncitation, and ribbon.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"34 FR 18291, PDF pages 7-7; Sec. 3","sha256":"f522d7ceb7cb8dd8a14d4ceaad5eecedb213f066d2dd6b9e5fc36c9b76b4d445","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1969-11-15/pdf/FR-1969-11-15.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11494#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec. 4. Prior orders.  The establishment of the Medal shall not oper­\nate to terminate any other medal and this order shall not be deemed  \nto supersede the whole or any part of any other Executive order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"34 FR 18291, PDF pages 7-7; Sec. 4","sha256":"f522d7ceb7cb8dd8a14d4ceaad5eecedb213f066d2dd6b9e5fc36c9b76b4d445","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1969-11-15/pdf/FR-1969-11-15.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11494#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"34 FR 18291, PDF pages 7-7","sha256":"f522d7ceb7cb8dd8a14d4ceaad5eecedb213f066d2dd6b9e5fc36c9b76b4d445","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1969-11-15/pdf/FR-1969-11-15.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 6 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: current legal basis not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"yes"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:11494"}
